      "options": {
        "content": "## CubeSandbox logs (Loki)\nSandbox `stdout`/`stderr` from `/data/cubelet/log/<sandbox-id>/`. Filter by **Cluster / Node / Sandbox ID / Log Stream**; **Log Filter (Regex)** is RE2 and `.*` matches everything. Sandbox ID and component name are structured metadata, not index labels. The **Component logs** row needs `observability.logs.components.enabled=true` (Helm only) and is empty otherwise.",
